>> list := Rārangi hou.
list ~ ['hello'].
Huaputa tuhi: list tatau.
list tāpiri-muri: ['world'].
Huaputa tuhi: list tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: list tango-whakamutunga, tuhi: list tatau.
list tāpiri-muri: ['there'].
Huaputa tuhi: list tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: (list tūnga: 0), tuhi: (list tūnga: 1).
list tuku: ['xmas'] kei: 1.
list tuku: ['merry'] kei: 0.
Huaputa tuhi: list tatau.
Huaputa tuhi: (list tūnga: 0), tuhi: (list tūnga: 1).
